      "message": "But actually it can’t prevent NPE completely, ie. Sub class ImsServiceCompatController override isServiceControllerAvailable(),Which in normal case return true, but it doesn\u0027t override the removeImsFeature , then NPE still happens, so override of removeImsFeature is necessary.",
