        "id": 1098053
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-06-25T17:32:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "mServiceController will be null in the case that ImsServiceControllerStaticCompat is used because mServiceController is never set. So, when isServiceControllerAvailable is called, mServiceController will be null and it will return false in the ImsServiceControllerStaticCompat case.\n\nI can make removeImsFeature and isServiceControllerAvailable final so that these methods are not accidentally extended in the future.",
      "parentUuid": "c1836033_30917dc3",
      "revId": "0903891b751394a5d3143e20a6ad0f6aba6db1a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4565e0b0_822ac26a",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ims/ImsServiceControllerCompat.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 159,
      "author": {
        "id": 1333993
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-06-26T06:13:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a good solution to make removeImsFeature and isServiceControllerAvailable final.\nSince isServiceControllerAvailable will be called to do some check, ie. whether the binding with ims service is ready, before we do some operations, eg. enableIms/disableIms etc. Even for ImsServiceControllerStaticCompat, we still need it. So ImsServiceControllerStaticCompat should override its own removeImsFeature and isServiceControllerAvailable, just like other functions.",
      "parentUuid": "95eaf184_fef0667a",
      "revId": "0903891b751394a5d3143e20a6ad0f6aba6db1a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "33d1c031_b02b1580",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/ims/ImsServiceControllerCompat.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 159,
      "author": {
        "id": 1098053
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-06-27T16:43:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "isServiceControllerAvailable is not needed for most operations, but it is checked by ImsServiceController in cleanup and addImsServiceFeature and removeImsServiceFeature, so I have added it there. \n\nI am still keeping removeImsFeature final, but not gating it on isServiceControllerAvailable anymore. I do not want to expose external state to ImsServiceControllerStaticCompat just for remove (especially since it is just duplicating code).",
      "parentUuid": "4565e0b0_822ac26a",
